# pomo timetable. One block per line:
#
#   <days>  <start>  <minutes>  <focus>  <title>
#
#   days     daily | mon-fri | sat,sun | mon,wed,fri  (mon tue wed thu fri sat sun)
#   start    HH:MM, 24h
#   minutes  how long the whole block runs
#   focus    length of each focus session inside the block
#   title    what the notification says to do
#
# Blank lines and #comments are ignored. Edits apply on the next tick, no
# restart needed. Check the day with:  pomo sched

